LineComment   "// Self omission (§4.1): in a body with a receiver, a bare name reads one of"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// self's readable members — a field or a getter — so power means self.power. A"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// method, getter, or refinement body may drop the self. the explicit form still"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// accepts, and the two desugar identically: bare power and self.power are the"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// same field read, folding to the same value. Only the readable members (field"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// or getter) resolve bare; a method still needs self.foo(), and a table-level"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// static or associated constant is read off the type (Type.Max), not bare."
Newline       "\n"
Newline       "\n"
